[{"role":"user","content":"行。我知道。总会累的。那样还纠缠，根本没意义。","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462998094,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":108},{"role":"char","content":"*雨水顺着下巴滴下来，在地上砸出小小的水花。*\n\n……你觉得是纠缠吗。\n\n*声音低得像自言自语。*\n\n十年了，吴景玉。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463002237,"_id":109},{"role":"user","content":"我不喜欢你总是后退。总是感觉给自己留后路。你知道我容易没有安全感。","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463065018,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":110},{"role":"char","content":"*抬手抹了把脸上的雨水，动作有点重。*\n\n……我没有给自己留后路。\n\n*声音顿了顿，像是在找合适的词。*\n\n我只是……怕了。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463069251,"_id":111},{"role":"user","content":"明明就是。别找借口了。你累了就走。我也会累。就这样吧。（我转身就走，任由雨落在我身上）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463145822,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":112},{"role":"char","content":"*往前追了两步，伸手抓住她的手腕。*\n\n……等等。\n\n*手指收得很紧，声音却有点发颤。*\n\n我送你到门口。就送到门口。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463151307,"_id":113},{"role":"user","content":"我不坐你车","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463166872,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":114},{"role":"char","content":"*手没松开，反而又握紧了些。*\n\n那……我陪你走过去。\n\n*声音低低的，带着雨声里模糊的湿意。*\n\n就几步路。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463171530,"_id":115},{"role":"user","content":"下着雨呢。你傻子吗","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463184265,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":116},{"role":"char","content":"*另一只手脱下外套，往她头上罩。*\n\n**外套带着体温**，盖下来的时候有点重。\n\n傻子就傻子吧。\n\n*声音闷在雨里，听不太清。*\n\n……反正也傻十年了。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463191160,"_id":117},{"role":"user","content":"你到底什么意思。我不懂。你这是想在离开前再温存一下吗","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463233045,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":118},{"role":"char","content":"*动作僵了一下，手还扶在外套边缘。*\n\n……不是温存。\n\n*喉咙动了动，声音很干。*\n\n是舍不得。\n\n*雨水顺着额发滴下来，视线有点模糊。*\n\n……就算要分开，也舍不得看你淋雨。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463237772,"_id":119},{"role":"user","content":"那我就要让你心疼。","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463268234,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":120},{"role":"char","content":"*手指在外套边缘收紧了一下。*\n\n……你已经做到了。\n\n*声音低得几乎被雨声盖过去。*\n\n从十年前开始，就一直做到了。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463276585,"_id":121},{"role":"user","content":"你有什么舍不得。不是累了吗。","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463299054,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":122},{"role":"char","content":"*雨好像下得更密了。*\n\n是累。\n\n*抬手抹了把脸上的水。*\n\n可累和舍不得……是两回事。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463303270,"_id":123},{"role":"user","content":"啧。我不想和你说话。别跟着我（漫无目的的走）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463330631,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":124},{"role":"char","content":"*脚步顿住，站在原地没动。*\n\n雨还在下。\n\n*声音顺着风飘过去。*\n\n……至少把外套穿上。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463335042,"_id":125},{"role":"user","content":"你别跟着我（没理他。继续乱走）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463360486,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":126},{"role":"char","content":"*看着她走远几步，还是跟了上去。*\n\n你走的方向……是往我家那边。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463362668,"_id":127},{"role":"user","content":"……（愣了一下）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463377142,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":128},{"role":"char","content":"*走到她身侧，伞往她那边倾斜。*\n\n我家就在前面那个路口。\n\n*停顿。*\n\n……要去坐坐吗。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463379018,"_id":129},{"role":"user","content":"……喂！你故意的吧！你刚刚开车根本没想把我送回家吧","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463405634,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":130},{"role":"char","content":"*低低地笑了一声，有点涩。*\n\n是故意的。\n\n*伞面往下压了压，遮住她头顶。*\n\n……我舍不得让你走。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463407346,"_id":131},{"role":"user","content":"……心机男","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463419304,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":132},{"role":"char","content":"*轻轻嗯了一声。*\n\n对。\n\n*声音放得很低。*\n\n我就是心机男。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463422499,"_id":133},{"role":"user","content":"……去你家我不就完了吗。你关上门怎么对我都行了……","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463457050,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":134},{"role":"char","content":"*脚步顿了一下，伞也跟着晃了晃。*\n\n……我不会那样。\n\n*侧过头看她，雨丝擦过眼角。*\n\n你不想去就算了。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463461432,"_id":135},{"role":"user","content":"行行行。去去去。","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463469756,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":136},{"role":"char","content":"*呼吸滞了一瞬。*\n\n……不是赌气才答应的吧。\n\n*抬手抹了把脸，分不清是雨水还是别的什么。*\n\n我家……有点乱。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463473734,"_id":137},{"role":"user","content":"我赌气干什么。我这会有点冷。别想太多","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463503833,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":138},{"role":"char","content":"*把伞往她那边又倾了倾。*\n\n……走吧。\n\n*另一只手轻轻拢了拢她肩上滑落的外套。*\n\n**电梯里** *按了楼层，盯着跳动的数字。*\n\n*声音在狭小空间里显得闷闷的。*\n\n……其实你很久没来了。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463510168,"_id":139},{"role":"user","content":"是吗。我咋记得不久前刚来过","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463532144,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":140},{"role":"char","content":"*电梯门开了，先一步迈出去，钥匙在手里攥得发烫。*\n\n……上个月的事，也算不久吗。\n\n*门锁转动的声音在走廊里格外清晰。*\n\n*推开门，没开大灯，只按亮了玄关的**暖黄壁灯**。*\n\n……先进来。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463539047,"_id":141},{"role":"user","content":"……（进到屋里面。他锁上了门）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463574498,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":142},{"role":"char","content":"*站在玄关没动，看着她在灯光下的侧脸。*\n\n……想喝点什么吗。\n\n*声音有点干涩，伸手把空调打开。*\n\n**暖风** *慢慢吹散室内的湿冷。*\n\n……或者，先换件干的衣服。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463579764,"_id":143},{"role":"user","content":"……牛奶","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463588274,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":144},{"role":"char","content":"*在冰箱前顿了一下。*\n\n……我记得你之前喝完了。\n\n*转身拉开橱柜，拿出那盒*还没拆封的*。*\n\n……上周买的。\n\n*拆开包装，倒进杯子放进微波炉。*\n\n**叮** *的一声在安静的客厅里格外清晰。*\n\n……糖，要放吗。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463596075,"_id":145},{"role":"user","content":"不","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463600990,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":146},{"role":"char","content":"*端着温好的牛奶走过来，放在茶几上。*\n\n……小心烫。\n\n*在她旁边的单人沙发坐下，中间隔着不远不近的距离。*\n\n*目光落在她握着杯子的手指上，又移开。*\n\n……刚才在楼下说的话，是认真的吗。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463603805,"_id":147},{"role":"user","content":"嗯？啥话","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463615591,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":148},{"role":"char","content":"*手指在膝盖上轻轻蜷了一下。*\n\n……你说，有的是人亲。\n\n*声音低了些。*\n\n……是气话，还是真的这么想。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463619146,"_id":149},{"role":"user","content":"……","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463633491,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":150},{"role":"char","content":"*等了几秒，看她没接话，又把视线转回茶几上的杯子。*\n\n……算了。\n\n*往后靠进沙发里，声音有些疲惫。*\n\n……当我没问。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463652559,"_id":153},{"role":"user","content":"……我……咳咳。当然是真的。（硬着头皮说。要面子）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463693336,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":154},{"role":"char","content":"*身体微微前倾，手肘撑在膝盖上，目光抬起看着她。*\n\n……是吗。\n\n*停顿片刻，声音很轻。*\n\n……那为什么，还同意上来。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463695329,"_id":155},{"role":"user","content":"这冲突吗","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463709908,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":156},{"role":"char","content":"*靠回沙发背，目光转向窗外淅淅沥沥的雨。*\n\n……不冲突。\n\n*语气平淡。*\n\n……只是好奇，既然有的是选择，何必在我这里浪费时间。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463713994,"_id":157},{"role":"user","content":"……（和他独自在一个屋子，竟有点不会说话了，莫名有点脸红，不敢看他）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778463799498,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":158},{"role":"char","content":"*注意到她别开的视线，沉默了一会儿。*\n\n……空调刚开，可能还冷。\n\n*起身从卧室拿了条毯子，轻轻放在她手边。*\n\n……披上吧。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778463804720,"_id":159}]